  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your natural weapons tear through your enemies with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Eldritch Claws<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your natural weapons bypass an amount of damage reduction equal to your mythic rank or tier. This applies to all types of damage reduction, including DR/- and DR/epic. In addition you may expend one use of your mythic power as a swift action to select any one type of damage reduction; your natural weapons bypass damage reduction (of any amount) of that type for 1 minute. You may use this ability multiple times, expending one use of mythic power and selecting a different form of damage reduction each time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
